<p>Both errors appear before the port opens, so no user ever hits a <code>NullPointerException</code> in the middle of a request. The fixes: mark the default implementation <code>@Primary</code> and use <code>@Qualifier("beanName")</code> where you need the other (exercise 3); add the missing stereotype annotation; or move the class under the package of the <code>@SpringBootApplication</code> class so the scan finds it.</p>
