<p>Two details are measured, not guessed. "Tomcat initialized" comes before the beans are created and "Tomcat started" after — so when a bean fails (slide 13) you see <code>Stopping service [Tomcat]</code> before the report. And <code>CommandLineRunner</code> output appears <em>after</em> "Started … in …" (the <code>ioc-thiet-bi</code> log, filtered on those lines):</p>
