<div class="callout">🕰 <strong>On Spring Boot 3.x</strong> adding <code>flyway-core</code> (and <code>flyway-database-postgresql</code>) was enough to switch Flyway on. The Spring Boot 4.0 Migration Guide: "spring-boot-starter-flyway and spring-boot-starter-liquibase are needed where only the third-party library was previously declared". Measured with the app <code>flyway-thieu-starter</code> — a Boot 3 habit on Boot 4.1.1:</div>
