<pre class="http-res"><code class="language-http">HTTP/1.1 401
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token", error_description="Unsupported algorithm of none", error_uri="https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6750#section-3.1", resource_metadata="http://localhost:8080/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource"</code></pre>
