<p>Layers still exist inside each feature — controller, service, repository — so nothing from CS.2/CS.3 is lost. What changes is the first level of folders: it now tells a reader what the application <em>does</em>. Removing reservations touches one package instead of five; adding "AI suggestions" adds one package.</p>
