<p>Compatibility, checked before use: springdoc.org states that v3 targets Spring Boot 4 and keeps v2.9.1 for Boot 3.x; the pom of springdoc-openapi 3.1.1 (released 09/2026) is built on spring-boot-starter-parent 4.1.0. Boot does not manage this version, so it is written in the pom:</p>
